    "releaseNotes": "Fixed: If you multi-day logged a recipe from My Recipes, nothing you logged would show up. Now your multi-day logs land exactly where and when you want them to.\n\nFor those using GLP-1 support, the legal disclaimer sheet was cutting off text and hiding the close button at larger accessibility text sizes. Now everything fits, no matter the text size.\n\n*Bye bye buggos! We scooped'em up with a paper cup and let'em go outside.\n\n*For all the latest fixes, update to the latest app version",
