    "description": "Achieve your nutrition, calorie, macro & fitness goals with MyFitnessPal – the AI-powered food & fitness tracker with everything you need. Calories, macros, food, workouts – track it all in one place with one of the most comprehensive health, nutrition & fitness tracking apps available. Now with a built-in AI nutrition Coach for personalized guidance based on your goals and history. Plus GLP-1 journey support - log doses and set reminders in the app.\n\nCreate personalized fitness & nutrition goals, build better habits around food, nutrition & calorie tracking and monitor your water intake. Download the app & start your free Premium trial today. With MyFitnessPal, you get food inspiration, an intermittent fasting tracker, science backed nutrition, and powerful fitness logging tools. MyFitnessPal is the #1 nutrition, macro & calorie tracking app in the U.S. – as featured in the New York Times, Forbes, the Today Show & U.S. News & World Report.\n\nMore than a calorie tracker & food journal – MyFitnessPal is an AI-powered health, nutrition & fitness platform built to help you track macros, monitor nutrition progress & crush your fitness goals.\n\nNEW FEATURE: AI COACH \n■ Nutrition insights tailored to your goals, habits, and logging history \n■ Guidance to find what you need in the app, faster\n\nNEW FEATURE: GLP-1 TRACKING\n■ Log & track how you feel on your GLP-1 medications to spot patterns in your symptoms & side effects.\n■ Stick to your schedule with custom reminders for your GLP-1 medication\n■ Build healthy habits that actually stick with simple, effective nutrition & medication for tracking your GLP-1 journey\n\nTRACK FOOD, CALORIES & MACROS WITH AI \n■ Log meals effortlessly from 20.5M+ foods, including restaurant dishes – nutrition & calorie tracking made simple \n■ Full nutrition & macro tracker breakdown – carbs, fat & protein – with custom targets for macros, protein, sodium, fiber & more \n■ Stay hydrated with the built-in water tracker\n\nFITNESS TRACKING, WORKOUTS & PROGRESS \n■ Log workouts & steps to monitor health, nutrition & calorie burn \n■ Track calories, macros, nutrition stats & health insights at a glance or dive deep into the details \n■ See how fitness activity, nutrition & diet affect your daily calorie goals \n■ Wear OS support – calorie tracker, water tracker & macro tracker on your wrist. Add complications to the home screen for faster logging and the tile for tracking nutrients at a glance\n\nPERSONALIZED FITNESS PLANS & NUTRITION TOOLS \n■ Customize calorie, nutrition & fitness goals – weight loss, gain, maintenance, or performance \n■ Personalized nutrition & health dashboard – stats all in one place \n■ Save meals & recipes for quick calorie, nutrition & macro logging \n■ Streamlined meal planner to simplify nutrition tracking & hit your calorie & macro targets \n■ Connect 40+ fitness trackers, smartwatches & health apps via one unified nutrition & fitness ecosystem \n■ Find friends & motivation in the MyFitnessPal community\n\nPREMIUM \n■ Faster nutrition, calorie & macro tracking with barcode scan, meal scan & voice logging \n■ Customized macro, calorie & nutrition goals tailored to your fitness targets \n■ Ad-free logging with built-in nutrition insights & calorie & macro progress comparisons \n■ Net Carbs Mode – track net carbs across all food, nutrition & macro logs for keto and low-carb diets\n\nPREMIUM PLUS \n■ All Premium features, including barcode scanning, now paired with full nutrition-focused meal planning \n■ Personalized meal plans, integrated grocery delivery & smart calorie, nutrition & macro tracking tools \n■ 1500+ healthy recipes tailored to your calorie, macro, nutrition & fitness goals\n\nMyFitnessPal is the leading health and fitness tracking app to help you conquer your calorie, nutrition & fitness goals.\n\nDownload today & start your free Premium trial.\n\nView our terms & conditions and privacy policy: \nhttps://www.myfitnesspal.com/terms-of-service \nhttps://www.myfitnesspal.com/privacy-policy",
